    "body": "Oh interesting. Yeah, I just assumed that the newer versions \"automatically\" supersede the old ones, but I guess not. I notice that v2 just says \"XSLT 2.0 is a revised version of the XSLT 1.0\", and both 2.0 and 3.0 are made to be backwards compatible. Thanks for pointing that out.\r\n\r\nSounds like the new language will work. Thanks for merging this.",
